        {
          "exampleId": "w:record#e-0a8ca4fde4264d24",
          "text": "Writing is one of humanity’s later achievements, and until fairly recently even many literate (有文字的) societies recorded their concerns not only in writing but in things.",
          "source": {
            "paperId": "paper-gaokao-2023-national-b",
