          },
          "tier": "gaokao"
        },
        {
          "exampleId": "w:record#e-33e3d40fc827efdd",
          "text": "Dr Catherine Hobaiter, who led the research, said that this was the only form of intentional communication to be recorded in the animal kingdom.",
